WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 35=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:48.480 --> 01:49.230
Fall back!

01:50.200 --> 01:51.680
That scoundrel Lin Jinqi

01:51.680 --> 01:53.070
is going to blow up the armory!

01:53.070 --> 01:53.870
Everyone, fall back!

01:57.000 --> 01:57.870
Kill him!

01:58.070 --> 01:59.000
- Yes!
- Yes!

04:20.580 --> 04:22.420
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

04:22.420 --> 04:26.860
♪For withholding its light♪

04:28.190 --> 04:29.680
Prince Han!

04:31.140 --> 04:34.580
♪Still live and thrive♪

04:37.070 --> 04:39.630
Lin Jinqi has ruined my plans.

04:39.870 --> 04:43.510
Only his death will satisfy my hatred!

04:44.560 --> 04:45.360
Wei Bao!

04:46.600 --> 04:47.190
Yes.

04:49.000 --> 04:52.560
Bring me Lin Jinqi's head.

04:53.310 --> 04:55.510
I shall make you a marquis!

04:56.510 --> 04:58.750
I swear I won't return

04:58.856 --> 05:00.170
until I've taken Lin Jinqi's head.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.430
Go!

05:14.720 --> 05:18.040
Lin Jinqi may have destroyed the armory,

05:19.120 --> 05:23.270
but I have the Changling Guards
and Shenji Battalion outside,

05:24.160 --> 05:25.830
and the Tiance Guards inside.

05:26.270 --> 05:29.270
With attacks from both sides, the
Imperial Guards won't stand a chance.

05:29.430 --> 05:30.720
- Yes!
- Yes!

05:33.800 --> 05:36.190
Follow me into the capital!

05:38.310 --> 05:40.070
You'll be made marquises and ministers!

05:47.560 --> 05:48.360
Young Madam.

05:48.720 --> 05:50.630
It's dangerous here. We can't stay long.

05:50.750 --> 05:51.950
We must hurry.

05:53.040 --> 05:53.950
The Shenji Battalion

05:55.160 --> 05:56.870
has joined Prince Han's rebellion.

05:58.424 --> 05:59.920
Why do you say that, Young Madam?

06:01.310 --> 06:02.870
If the Shenji Battalion hadn't rebelled,

06:03.560 --> 06:05.630
Young Master wouldn't
have destroyed the armory.

06:06.344 --> 06:08.730
Prince Han must have taken control
of the Shenji Battalion.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.390
Young Master had no other choice

06:10.440 --> 06:12.376
but to destroy
the weapons at their source

06:12.408 --> 06:14.680
to keep Prince Han
from using firearms to attack the city.

06:16.680 --> 06:17.830
This billowing smoke

06:18.270 --> 06:19.680
also serves as a warning signal.

06:20.240 --> 06:22.430
If anyone sees it, they'll report it.

06:24.088 --> 06:25.750
The Imperial Guards defending the city

06:26.056 --> 06:27.920
will close the city gates
as soon as possible.

06:30.104 --> 06:31.190
Then Deputy Commander Lin...

06:31.390 --> 06:32.390
Is he... Is he safe?

06:35.830 --> 06:36.680
I don't know.

06:38.160 --> 06:40.870
But even if he's alive,

06:41.544 --> 06:42.950
his life is hanging by a thread.

06:43.336 --> 06:44.870
There's no telling if he'll survive.

06:46.510 --> 06:47.800
Deputy Commander Lin

06:48.510 --> 06:49.830
only has Nanke with him.

07:05.920 --> 07:06.950
Young Master always says

07:07.688 --> 07:10.190
a husband and wife are one
and share both fortune and hardship.

07:11.360 --> 07:12.390
Now that he's in danger,

07:13.390 --> 07:14.720
I can't stand by and do nothing.

07:16.070 --> 07:17.190
Go save Young Master.

07:20.750 --> 07:21.510
No.

07:21.672 --> 07:23.120
Deputy Commander Lin gave us orders

07:23.510 --> 07:25.720
to escort you back to the retreat.

07:26.240 --> 07:28.190
Young Madam,
please get in the carriage.

07:32.600 --> 07:34.040
Having a group of soldiers follow me

07:34.270 --> 07:35.680
will only draw attention.

07:36.270 --> 07:37.000
Besides,

07:37.310 --> 07:38.800
you're soldiers of the imperial court.

07:39.800 --> 07:41.360
Your duty is to protect the people,

07:42.040 --> 07:43.430
not me alone.

07:44.600 --> 07:45.950
If you can save Young Master,

07:46.310 --> 07:48.310
you may also be able to help
the Imperial Guards

07:48.800 --> 07:50.310
and keep the people safe.

07:53.928 --> 07:55.730
Your selflessness
is admirable, Young Madam.

07:56.190 --> 07:57.830
Forgive me for breaking my word.

07:58.310 --> 07:59.830
I cannot keep my promise

08:00.190 --> 08:02.390
to escort you back to the retreat.

08:16.510 --> 08:17.430
Men!

08:17.680 --> 08:19.870
Let's go meet Prince Han's forces.

08:19.920 --> 08:20.950
- Yes!
- Yes!

08:22.070 --> 08:22.630
Hyah!

08:23.160 --> 08:23.510
Hyah!

08:32.240 --> 08:33.000
Young Madam.

08:33.910 --> 08:34.840
Let's go back...

08:36.150 --> 08:37.270
Back to the retreat.

08:56.670 --> 08:57.360
Young Master.

09:06.856 --> 09:08.390
(Command Token)
Take this command token

09:08.696 --> 09:10.520
(of the Shence Garrison Commander)
and go to the Five Armies Camp.

09:10.840 --> 09:12.630
Ask Duke Ying to send troops.

09:13.840 --> 09:15.390
Only by holding Prince Han back

09:16.200 --> 09:18.240
can the Imperial Guards
focus on attacking

09:18.600 --> 09:20.670
the Tiance Guards
who infiltrated the city

09:21.120 --> 09:22.670
and lift the siege on the Imperial City.

09:23.750 --> 09:26.840
Duke Ying strictly follows
the rules and refuses to bend.

09:27.000 --> 09:29.990
Without His Majesty's handwritten edict
or orders from the Ministry of War,

09:30.024 --> 09:32.080
my word alone won't
convince him to deploy troops.

09:32.080 --> 09:33.360
Back then, the late Emperor

09:34.150 --> 09:36.750
thought Prince Han was much like himself

09:37.720 --> 09:40.790
and wanted to depose the Crown Prince
and make Prince Han his heir.

09:41.000 --> 09:43.120
It was Duke Ying
who dissuaded the late Emperor.

09:43.870 --> 09:45.360
Though the matter was confidential,

09:45.910 --> 09:47.910
others still knew about it.

09:48.320 --> 09:49.840
If Prince Han takes the throne

09:50.360 --> 09:51.670
and learns of this,

09:52.440 --> 09:54.080
what will become of Duke Ying?

09:54.750 --> 09:57.000
And what will become of the hundred

09:57.510 --> 09:58.910
or so members of his household?

10:04.000 --> 10:05.670
Ask Duke Ying for me

10:06.750 --> 10:08.320
if he still remembers

10:09.080 --> 10:12.630
what happened
to Grand Secretary Shen back then.

10:17.510 --> 10:18.440
I remember.

10:19.840 --> 10:20.750
I remember.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.670
Go.

10:28.270 --> 10:29.120
But Young Master...

10:29.840 --> 10:30.790
Go.

10:32.630 --> 10:34.320
That's an order.

10:40.080 --> 10:41.270
With me,

10:41.630 --> 10:43.200
you won't be able to move fast.

10:47.080 --> 10:48.320
Ride.

10:49.440 --> 10:50.270
Go!

10:51.870 --> 10:53.000
Hurry!

11:02.080 --> 11:03.030
Take care, Young Master!

11:23.300 --> 11:27.100
♪With my own hands and heart♪

11:27.100 --> 11:30.140
♪I write my name♪

11:30.820 --> 11:34.500
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

11:34.860 --> 11:37.820
♪Step by step toward the light♪

11:37.820 --> 11:41.980
♪With what I know and what I do♪

11:41.980 --> 11:45.340
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

11:45.380 --> 11:47.420
♪The long night is almost over♪

11:47.420 --> 11:55.420
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

12:12.270 --> 12:14.240
Lin Jinqi can't have gone far.

12:14.632 --> 12:15.790
Search everywhere carefully.

12:16.480 --> 12:18.320
With his head, I'll be made a marquis.

12:19.270 --> 12:20.910
You'll all be rewarded, too.

12:21.150 --> 12:22.200
- Yes!
- Yes!

12:29.360 --> 12:30.200
Captain Wei.

12:43.790 --> 12:45.630
Lin Jinqi stopped here.

12:46.152 --> 12:48.030
The heavy snow
hasn't covered his tracks yet.

12:50.200 --> 12:51.630
He can't have left long ago.

12:52.440 --> 12:53.360
Go after him at once!

12:53.360 --> 12:54.024
- Yes!
- Yes!

13:57.544 --> 13:58.808
Prince Han has twisted the truth

13:58.824 --> 14:00.630
and accused
the Imperial Guards of rebellion.

14:00.640 --> 14:02.380
Under the pretext
of suppressing the rebellion,

14:02.390 --> 14:03.430
he led the Changling Guards

14:03.440 --> 14:04.830
and the Shenji Battalion
to attack Xizhi Gate

14:04.840 --> 14:06.090
in an attempt to enter the city.

14:06.104 --> 14:07.630
Fortunately, the Imperial Guards
defending the city

14:07.630 --> 14:09.660
saw the billowing warning smoke
from the Shenji Battalion's direction

14:09.670 --> 14:11.192
and locked the city gates in advance.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.296
(Yang Pu, Deputy Commander)
They have kept Prince Han's

14:12.300 --> 14:13.368
(of the Imperial Guard, Lower Third-Rank)
army outside the city.

14:13.480 --> 14:15.110
The two sides are now engaged in battle.

14:15.120 --> 14:16.030
For the time being,

14:16.072 --> 14:18.190
they can't spare
any forces to aid the Imperial City.

14:19.048 --> 14:20.480
(Second Prince)
Then what do we do?

14:20.648 --> 14:22.072
(Eldest Imperial Son)
That scoundrel Tian Fang

14:22.088 --> 14:23.496
has already led the Tiance Guards

14:23.550 --> 14:24.790
to Wu Gate?

14:25.910 --> 14:27.390
After receiving Fengtai's warning,

14:27.630 --> 14:30.240
I issued an edict mobilizing
the City Patrol Offices

14:30.440 --> 14:32.030
to help defend the Imperial City.

14:32.320 --> 14:33.840
Where are the City Patrol Offices now?

14:34.776 --> 14:36.140
Some men in the City Patrol Offices

14:36.150 --> 14:37.840
were also deceived by Prince Han.

14:38.790 --> 14:39.550
Right now,

14:39.960 --> 14:41.370
the two sides are fighting fiercely.

14:54.240 --> 14:55.030
Your Majesty.

14:55.550 --> 14:57.080
The rebels are advancing in force.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.510
In my opinion,

14:58.790 --> 15:00.870
Your Majesty should leave the palace

15:00.960 --> 15:03.000
and take refuge
outside the city for now.

15:05.630 --> 15:06.320
Yes.

15:06.440 --> 15:09.550
Father, we should take refuge for now.

15:10.150 --> 15:11.440
Grand Secretary Zhao is right.

15:11.440 --> 15:12.200
Father.

15:12.248 --> 15:14.248
We should follow
Grand Secretary Zhao's advice.

15:17.120 --> 15:18.910
If Your Majesty leaves the palace,

15:19.360 --> 15:21.270
first, the rebels
will find the palace empty

15:21.360 --> 15:22.510
and their morale will plummet.

15:22.960 --> 15:23.480
Second,

15:23.750 --> 15:27.390
the Imperial Guard can fight
the rebels without restraint.

15:27.600 --> 15:29.630
As their strength wanes and ours grows,

15:29.960 --> 15:33.270
we will surely wipe out
the rebels in one stroke.

15:33.944 --> 15:35.240
Grand Secretary Zhao is right.

15:35.672 --> 15:36.720
There's no time to lose.

15:36.790 --> 15:38.550
Father, leave the palace at once.

15:44.600 --> 15:47.150
Your Majesty, please leave the palace.

15:47.720 --> 15:51.030
- Your Majesty, please leave the palace.
- Your Majesty, please leave the palace.

15:59.672 --> 16:01.080
Grand Secretary Zhao, may I ask,

16:01.960 --> 16:04.520
if His Majesty is to leave
the palace, an edict must be drafted.

16:04.910 --> 16:05.750
How

16:06.870 --> 16:07.960
should this edict be worded?

16:08.910 --> 16:11.880
You're merely an official of the
Hanlin Academy. Just follow your orders.

16:12.240 --> 16:14.840
You have no place speaking in this hall!

16:15.320 --> 16:18.480
I am the Hanlin Academy official
on duty in the palace today.

16:18.790 --> 16:21.080
As I am to draft this edict,

16:21.840 --> 16:23.270
I must know every detail

16:23.960 --> 16:25.000
clearly and precisely.

16:25.480 --> 16:27.272
Grand Secretary Zhao
advised Your Majesty

16:27.288 --> 16:29.000
to abandon the palace
and leave the city.

16:29.550 --> 16:31.440
How am I supposed to twist the truth

16:32.390 --> 16:33.550
to make this action

16:33.768 --> 16:35.256
sound justifiable in the edict,

16:35.840 --> 16:38.360
instead of demoralizing our forces

16:39.120 --> 16:40.790
and emboldening the rebels?

16:42.360 --> 16:43.750
Compiler Han is right.

16:44.056 --> 16:45.550
Grand Secretary Zhao is a learned man.

16:45.550 --> 16:46.600
Then please tell us,

16:46.720 --> 16:49.390
how should this edict be drafted?

16:55.390 --> 16:57.870
I once followed
the late Emperor in his uprising.

16:58.240 --> 17:01.320
The situation then was a hundred times
more perilous than today.

17:01.832 --> 17:03.960
Had the late Emperor
not adapted to the circumstances

17:04.088 --> 17:05.592
without fear of what others might say,

17:05.960 --> 17:08.550
we would not have this vast realm today.

17:09.400 --> 17:10.200
Your Majesty.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.680
Seize Zhao Jin and Dai Qing.

17:25.070 --> 17:26.350
Bind them here.

17:26.750 --> 17:30.270
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

17:31.270 --> 17:32.070
Your Majesty!

17:32.504 --> 17:34.510
I have only ever acted
in Your Majesty's interests.

17:34.510 --> 17:36.640
What crime
have I committed, Your Majesty?

17:38.030 --> 17:38.830
Your Majesty!

17:40.110 --> 17:40.550
Move!

17:47.350 --> 17:48.830
Zhao Jin and Dai Qing

17:49.096 --> 17:51.880
harbor treacherous intentions
and spread lies to mislead everyone.

17:52.110 --> 17:53.550
Confine them here for now.

17:53.752 --> 17:56.310
They will answer for their crimes
once the rebellion is quelled.

17:57.240 --> 17:59.790
When Father attacked Jinan,

18:00.350 --> 18:02.510
I was ordered to defend Beiping.

18:03.200 --> 18:05.880
With ten thousand troops,
I faced an army of 500,000.

18:05.960 --> 18:07.200
Yet the city held.

18:07.920 --> 18:09.590
I had no fear then.

18:09.960 --> 18:11.640
Why should a mere band of rebels

18:11.960 --> 18:13.590
make me lose my composure today?

18:14.400 --> 18:15.750
Pass down my command.

18:16.480 --> 18:19.110
Imperial Guard,
fall back to Qianqing Gate.

18:19.200 --> 18:20.640
Seal off Qianqing Palace.

18:21.200 --> 18:23.000
No one is to enter or leave.

18:23.550 --> 18:24.510
Anyone who disobeys

18:25.000 --> 18:25.880
will be killed!

18:27.030 --> 18:28.200
Your Majesty is wise!

18:29.070 --> 18:30.960
- Your Majesty is wise!
- Your Majesty is wise!

18:32.750 --> 18:33.960
Wang Cheng, Hai Tao.

18:34.590 --> 18:37.030
Distribute the weapons
to the guards and palace maids.

18:37.440 --> 18:37.960
Yes.

18:41.920 --> 18:42.920
Everyone,

18:43.790 --> 18:45.960
follow me to Qianqing Gate and fight.

18:46.350 --> 18:48.270
We'll  follow
Your Majesty to the death!

18:48.280 --> 18:51.230
- We'll follow Your Majesty to the death!
- We'll follow Your Majesty to the death!

18:51.240 --> 18:53.580
(Upholding Heaven's Mandate)

18:54.920 --> 18:55.310
Hurry!

18:55.336 --> 18:56.290
He should be just ahead.

19:14.270 --> 19:15.640
Search carefully.

19:16.550 --> 19:17.440
He's wounded.

19:17.512 --> 19:18.510
He can't have gone far.

19:20.200 --> 19:21.440
You two, search over there.

19:22.920 --> 19:24.270
The rest of you, follow me.

19:24.350 --> 19:25.160
Yes.

19:31.960 --> 19:33.030
Young Master!

19:35.240 --> 19:36.310
Take care!

20:16.440 --> 20:18.030
Lin Jinqi was struck by my arrow

20:18.750 --> 20:20.000
and caught in the blast.

20:20.000 --> 20:21.160
He suffered internal injuries.

20:21.640 --> 20:23.960
He's barely alive
after making it this far.

20:24.350 --> 20:26.070
He can't even hold his blade anymore.

20:27.550 --> 20:28.440
Men!

20:29.270 --> 20:32.550
Noble titles and high office
are within our grasp!

22:01.720 --> 22:03.000
Wei Bao!

22:06.030 --> 22:07.480
You wretched fool!

22:08.480 --> 22:10.440
I'll take your head

22:10.440 --> 22:12.550
and use it as a chamber pot!

22:20.960 --> 22:22.550
Where did this scoundrel come from?

22:22.720 --> 22:24.110
You dare challenge me

22:24.200 --> 22:25.680
with so few men?

22:25.880 --> 22:26.550
Men!

22:26.880 --> 22:28.350
Kill him first,

22:28.680 --> 22:29.790
and then capture Lin Jinqi!

22:29.790 --> 22:30.920
Wei, you wretch!

22:32.030 --> 22:34.400
You can't even catch me,

22:34.960 --> 22:37.310
yet you think you can catch Lin Jinqi?

22:41.160 --> 22:42.550
Lin Jinqi

22:43.790 --> 22:45.720
left long ago.

22:52.030 --> 22:54.350
Go to the underworld

22:54.720 --> 22:56.480
and dream on!

22:56.680 --> 22:58.000
Kill!

22:58.060 --> 23:00.900
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

23:00.900 --> 23:05.180
♪For withholding its light♪

23:05.860 --> 23:09.220
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

23:09.220 --> 23:12.900
♪Still live and thrive♪

23:13.260 --> 23:17.380
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

23:17.380 --> 23:20.420
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

23:20.740 --> 23:24.780
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

23:24.780 --> 23:29.860
♪You and I will walk there together♪

24:03.720 --> 24:04.720
It's me.

24:08.020 --> 24:10.700
♪The golden sunset♪

24:10.700 --> 24:14.060
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

24:15.900 --> 24:18.420
♪All things fall silent, fearing♪

24:18.420 --> 24:21.780
♪To disturb this moment♪

24:22.460 --> 24:25.540
♪My restless heart♪

24:25.860 --> 24:29.220
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

24:29.940 --> 24:35.260
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

24:38.580 --> 24:41.500
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

24:41.500 --> 24:45.140
♪Lightly traced cause and effect♪

24:48.720 --> 24:49.400
Come on.

24:52.580 --> 24:56.100
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

24:56.100 --> 24:59.780
♪If the image isn't real,
what does it matter?♪

25:00.420 --> 25:05.140
♪I still remember your name♪

25:07.580 --> 25:10.060
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

25:10.060 --> 25:14.820
♪For withholding its light♪

25:15.300 --> 25:18.540
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

25:18.540 --> 25:22.340
♪Still live and thrive♪

25:22.740 --> 25:27.180
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

25:27.180 --> 25:29.780
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

25:29.780 --> 25:34.140
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

25:34.140 --> 25:38.700
♪You and I will walk there together♪

25:53.030 --> 25:53.510
Go.

25:54.270 --> 25:54.880
Go.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.680
Will Sun Yong be all right?

26:04.790 --> 26:06.030
He's a seasoned soldier.

26:06.960 --> 26:08.200
Once I'm gone,

26:09.200 --> 26:11.000
he won't fight them head-on.

26:19.000 --> 26:20.310
Why are you here?

26:25.590 --> 26:26.790
I don't want to be a widow.

26:28.200 --> 26:30.830
The Emperor arranged our marriage,
so I can't remarry.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.240
Where did you get this mule?

26:52.070 --> 26:53.510
I bought it from an old farmer.

26:54.270 --> 26:55.110
Around here,

26:55.256 --> 26:56.720
mules are more useful than horses.

26:59.830 --> 27:00.590
Brown sugar.

27:00.760 --> 27:01.920
You've lost too much blood.

27:01.992 --> 27:03.070
There's no hot water here,

27:03.510 --> 27:04.400
so make do with this.

27:06.240 --> 27:07.590
I just saw you

27:08.640 --> 27:09.920
feed some to the mule.

27:11.830 --> 27:12.790
Young Master Lin,

27:12.960 --> 27:14.240
it's freezing out here.

27:14.240 --> 27:16.580
If I don't feed it something good,
how will it keep going?

27:31.030 --> 27:31.680
Young Master.

27:35.000 --> 27:35.790
Young Master.

27:36.480 --> 27:37.310
Don't fall asleep.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.550
Talk to me.

27:40.240 --> 27:41.030
Young Master.

27:43.000 --> 27:44.000
Lin Jinqi.

27:44.200 --> 27:45.160
Lin Jinqi!

28:05.992 --> 28:07.960
Everyone in the Lin family
is counting on you.

28:09.440 --> 28:10.680
You have to stay alive.

28:12.110 --> 28:13.200
Stay alive.

28:13.510 --> 28:14.720
You have to stay alive!

28:19.750 --> 28:21.590
Lin Jinqi, don't fall asleep.

28:26.590 --> 28:27.070
Go.

28:45.480 --> 28:46.160
Help!

28:46.160 --> 28:47.440
Stop! Don't run!

28:50.240 --> 28:51.550
Go. Check over there.

28:53.352 --> 28:54.650
There are still people upstairs.

28:56.960 --> 28:57.440
Go.

29:30.110 --> 29:30.880
Jinlan.

29:31.750 --> 29:33.480
Why don't we have Second Butler Yang

29:33.830 --> 29:35.720
bar the main gate from outside?

29:36.030 --> 29:37.240
If the rebels come,

29:37.680 --> 29:38.920
at least it'll slow them down.

29:39.830 --> 29:41.310
A wooden door won't stop the rebels.

29:41.528 --> 29:43.000
They'll kick it open in one blow.

29:44.310 --> 29:45.240
Why don't we

29:45.790 --> 29:48.000
barricade the door
with tables and chairs?

29:50.280 --> 29:51.672
This is the Empty Fort Strategy.

29:54.480 --> 29:55.920
Chancellor Zhuge used this strategy

29:56.480 --> 29:58.480
to frighten off Sima Yi's vast army.

29:58.640 --> 30:00.000
As long as we all stay well hidden,

30:00.024 --> 30:01.310
we should have no trouble fooling

30:01.680 --> 30:02.830
a few soldiers and bandits.

30:03.880 --> 30:05.750
The neighborhood
where the troupe is based

30:06.640 --> 30:08.590
is home to people
with no money or influence.

30:08.920 --> 30:10.310
There's nothing worth taking here.

30:11.128 --> 30:13.440
A large group of soldiers
and bandits is unlikely to come.

30:14.270 --> 30:16.510
Even if a few stragglers

30:16.920 --> 30:18.750
come looking for valuables,

30:19.510 --> 30:21.030
they'll surely be in a hurry.

30:21.830 --> 30:23.750
If they see the theater doors wide open,

30:24.350 --> 30:25.750
they'll assume everyone has fled.

30:27.350 --> 30:28.590
If the doors are locked,

30:29.160 --> 30:31.240
they'll suspect someone is inside

30:31.830 --> 30:33.160
and break in.

30:35.030 --> 30:35.920
Xiuwan,

30:36.536 --> 30:38.240
those two years of study weren't wasted.

30:41.550 --> 30:42.270
Anyone in there?

30:43.000 --> 30:43.640
Get out here!

30:45.160 --> 30:45.880
Stop hiding!

30:50.110 --> 30:51.480
Come out now!

30:51.544 --> 30:53.790
If we have to find you
ourselves, you'll regret it!

30:53.920 --> 30:55.070
Let me find you.

30:55.110 --> 30:56.000
Come out now!

31:00.240 --> 31:01.640
It's just a rundown theater.

31:01.640 --> 31:02.350
Let's go.

31:02.360 --> 31:03.400
Let's look somewhere else.

31:03.400 --> 31:04.030
Go.

31:07.110 --> 31:08.110
Give me my money back!

31:16.880 --> 31:18.200
Everyone inside, come out!

31:18.350 --> 31:19.160
We heard you!

31:19.550 --> 31:20.270
Get out here now!

31:20.312 --> 31:22.160
I didn't notice
the young lady had woken up.

31:22.160 --> 31:22.960
It's my fault.

31:28.830 --> 31:29.480
Come out!

31:30.440 --> 31:31.480
Yingzhi is still little.

31:32.720 --> 31:34.200
Xiulai, don't cover her like that.

31:34.200 --> 31:35.550
Get out here! Do you hear me?

31:36.480 --> 31:38.160
Be careful not to hurt Yingzhi.

31:38.160 --> 31:39.030
If we find you,

31:39.400 --> 31:40.830
we'll tear you to pieces!

31:44.590 --> 31:46.270
If you don't come out, we're coming in!

31:46.536 --> 31:48.000
You'd better not let us catch you!

31:48.590 --> 31:49.510
Get out here!

31:52.070 --> 31:53.750
We already heard something inside.

31:53.960 --> 31:55.240
Someone's definitely in there.

31:55.590 --> 31:56.480
I'll go out.

31:56.790 --> 31:59.240
This is my fault. I'll lure them away.

31:59.240 --> 32:01.110
No, Xiulai.

32:01.480 --> 32:02.750
Stay hidden here.

32:03.400 --> 32:04.480
Don't make a sound.

32:04.640 --> 32:05.880
I'm losing my patience!

32:06.790 --> 32:08.110
Yingzhi and I will go out.

32:33.720 --> 32:34.920
Get out here! Do you hear me?

32:35.350 --> 32:37.030
Our patience is running out!

32:37.830 --> 32:38.720
We're coming in!

33:04.790 --> 33:05.510
Yingzhi.

33:06.920 --> 33:08.750
From now on, let's play a game.

33:10.000 --> 33:11.830
Pretend you're mute and can't speak.

33:12.350 --> 33:13.200
I'm your father.

33:17.440 --> 33:19.200
I'll go with Second Young Master.

33:20.776 --> 33:22.152
Since we can't beat them anyway,

33:22.160 --> 33:23.850
more people would
only make things worse.

33:24.580 --> 33:27.380
(Yang Fu, Butler of the Lin Residence
in the Capital)

34:11.150 --> 34:12.510
The snow will be deep tomorrow.

34:12.670 --> 34:14.400
I'll ask Xiulai and Xiuwan to join us,

34:15.960 --> 34:17.592
and we'll build a snowman together.

34:19.230 --> 34:19.880
Okay.

34:36.510 --> 34:38.670
Xiulai, don't worry.

34:40.550 --> 34:43.150
Jinlan will bring Yingzhi back safely.

34:48.710 --> 34:49.590
Hurry up and come out!

34:50.150 --> 34:51.670
I can hear a child crying!

34:52.280 --> 34:54.440
Sir...

34:55.880 --> 34:57.320
I...

34:59.920 --> 35:00.710
What's going on?

35:01.150 --> 35:02.280
Where is everyone?

35:07.190 --> 35:07.880
Lord Lin...

35:08.440 --> 35:09.920
Lord Lin asked the troupe leader

35:10.190 --> 35:11.670
to perform for Madam Lin's birthday.

35:12.190 --> 35:13.480
Before dawn this morning,

35:14.070 --> 35:16.190
the troupe leader
took the troupe out of the city.

35:17.670 --> 35:18.320
The stagehands

35:19.110 --> 35:21.670
went along to carry
the costumes and dressing tables.

35:22.376 --> 35:24.000
Only one old stagehand stayed behind.

35:24.248 --> 35:26.488
When he heard there was trouble
in the city, he ran away.

35:28.480 --> 35:30.400
That matches
what the woman earlier said.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.000
Then why didn't you run?

35:36.230 --> 35:36.840
I...

35:37.360 --> 35:38.510
I have tuberculosis.

35:39.110 --> 35:39.960
I can't run.

35:45.440 --> 35:46.710
And I have a mute daughter.

35:49.190 --> 35:50.760
We'll just live for as long as we can.

35:52.616 --> 35:53.440
What rotten luck.

36:07.070 --> 36:08.590
The little girl does

36:09.000 --> 36:10.280
look sickly.

36:11.550 --> 36:12.000
Let's go.

37:19.670 --> 37:20.280
Yingzhi.

37:21.960 --> 37:23.480
This is our little secret.

37:24.440 --> 37:25.590
Don't tell anyone.

37:33.800 --> 37:34.800
The game is over.

37:35.110 --> 37:36.000
You can talk now.

37:38.070 --> 37:39.000
Why?

37:43.670 --> 37:44.880
Because I know

37:45.670 --> 37:47.110
what heartache feels like.

37:49.710 --> 37:51.590
I don't want your Aunt Xiuwan,
your mother,

37:52.280 --> 37:53.880
or your Aunt Suhua to be heartbroken.

38:02.800 --> 38:03.710
Let's go home.

38:16.110 --> 38:17.150
The soldiers are gone?

38:18.440 --> 38:18.960
They're gone.

38:24.190 --> 38:24.630
Come on.

38:27.580 --> 38:31.740
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

38:34.580 --> 38:38.620
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

38:40.820 --> 38:44.300
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

38:46.550 --> 38:48.400
Thank goodness Jinlan was here.

38:50.550 --> 38:51.960
Otherwise, we would all have...

38:54.940 --> 38:58.820
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

38:58.820 --> 39:01.940
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

39:01.940 --> 39:05.940
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

39:05.940 --> 39:08.700
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

39:08.700 --> 39:12.980
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

39:12.980 --> 39:16.100
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

39:16.100 --> 39:20.020
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

39:20.020 --> 39:24.300
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

40:04.070 --> 40:04.880
Cold.

40:06.872 --> 40:08.030
I didn't dare light a fire.

40:08.030 --> 40:09.540
The smoke might draw the soldiers here.

40:09.550 --> 40:11.000
You'll have to make do, Young Master.

40:11.760 --> 40:13.110
Here, drink some water.

40:27.280 --> 40:27.840
Young Master.

40:38.800 --> 40:39.960
Where are we?

40:40.392 --> 40:43.000
The old man said there's a reed marsh
at the foot of the mountain.

40:43.320 --> 40:45.480
They raise ducks there in the summer.

40:45.670 --> 40:46.710
To keep watch over them,

40:47.096 --> 40:48.590
they built a simple thatched shelter.

41:19.280 --> 41:20.230
Now,

41:20.744 --> 41:22.710
I no longer
have the strength to protect you.

41:24.510 --> 41:25.800
Use this to defend yourself.

41:30.000 --> 41:30.710
This is...

41:30.960 --> 41:31.960
This is a firearm.

41:32.280 --> 41:33.320
Like a bow,

41:33.480 --> 41:35.000
it can kill enemies from a distance.

41:35.112 --> 41:37.760
But you have to load gunpowder
and a projectile after every shot.

41:43.710 --> 41:44.840
Load the gunpowder.

41:51.000 --> 41:52.360
Load the projectile.

42:04.630 --> 42:06.150
Open the flash pan cover.

42:14.670 --> 42:16.030
Light the fuse.

42:18.320 --> 42:19.550
Then aim.

43:04.820 --> 43:07.380
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:14.000 --> 43:16.320
You beast! I'll kill you!

43:24.480 --> 43:25.030
Come on!

43:25.150 --> 43:26.230
I'll kill you!

43:27.704 --> 43:28.760
Is that all you've got?

43:28.880 --> 43:29.590
I'm fine.

43:29.670 --> 43:30.960
She's just a woman.

43:46.661 --> 43:50.781
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:53.621 --> 43:58.141
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

43:59.421 --> 44:03.341
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:04.021 --> 44:06.781
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:07.501 --> 44:09.821
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:09.821 --> 44:12.901
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:14.421 --> 44:18.661
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:21.581 --> 44:25.741
